ink for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a> who then gives the player character a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Greater_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Greater Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/POT_Potion_of_Greater_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Greater_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Greater Healing\">Potion of Greater Healing</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The paper is torn and patched in many places, as if it was well-used but treasured. On it is a small poem without a name.]\n</p><p><br>\nThese empty sheets are all that's left of you.\n</p><p>The last of all the thoughtless gifts you gave.\n</p><p>I will hold onto them; it's all that I can do.\n</p><p>I can't throw them away; I've never been that brave.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195736\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 